<title>USA: Dycom Industries names Nielsen president/COO.</title>
<headline>Dycom Industries names Nielsen president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH GARDENS, Fla. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dycom Industries Inc said Monday that Steven Nielsen, a current vice president, was named president and chief operating officer of the company.</p>
<p>In a release issued Monday, Dycom said Nielsen has knowledge of both telecommunications and electrical services.</p>
